{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]菩提行經卷第一","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"聖龍樹菩薩集頌","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]宋西天中印度惹爛馱囉國三藏明教大師天息災奉詔譯","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]讚菩提心品第一","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]如佛妙法體無邊　佛子正心歸命禮.　[五]佛甘露戒垂覆護　我今讚說悉依法.","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"此說無有未曾有　亦非自我而獨專　我無自他如是時　乃自思惟觀察作.","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如是發心觀察時　能令我此善增長　時見如是娑婆界　此乃是彼佛世尊.","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[六]此界刹那難得生　得生爲人宜自慶　思惟若離菩提心　復次此來何以得.","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如雲覆蔽夜黑暗　閃電光明刹那現　佛威德利亦復然　刹那發意人獲福。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[七]是故善少力雖劣　能破大惡之業力　如是若發菩提心　此善勇進能超彼.","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"思惟無量無邊劫　見佛鹹說此真實　若不快樂得快樂　增長救度無邊衆.","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"爲諸有情處衆苦　令離百千諸苦怖　受多快樂百千種　爲恆不離菩提心.","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]梵藏二本題曰入菩提行.寂天造.","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]原刻譯號首無宋字.國下有密林寺三字.師下有賜紫沙門四字.今皆改正.次後各卷同.","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]二本釋菩提心功德品第一.","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]本論大文三分.今甲初明入因.作論緣起.","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]二本此半頌意雲.如教略說入.佛子律儀事.佛子律儀卽菩薩行.","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[六]大文甲次明所入.本論正宗.又三.今乙初明根器所依.種姓具足.","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[七]乙次明加行所依.發菩提心.又二.丙初讚菩提心功德.又二.丁初總讚.又四.今戊初讚爲安樂因.","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]彼善逝子處纏蓋　行在輪迴無所愛　若刹那說菩提心　人天歡喜悉歸命.","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若有受持不淨像　喻佛寶像而無價　如藥變化徧堅牢　等修持妙菩提心.","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"菩提心寶驗無邊　價直世閒無可喻　[二]調御行人伴侶等　悉使受持而堅牢.","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]芭蕉不實而生實　生實芭蕉而身謝　菩提心樹而清淨　恆生勝果而不盡.","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"已作暴惡衆罪業　依菩提心刹那脫　勇猛依託無大怖　彼癡有情何不依.","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"譬如劫盡時大火　刹那焚燒罪業薪　[四]若讚慈尊無量言　是曰善哉之智者。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]彼種種覺心　正智而平等　菩提誓願心　而行菩提行.","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"喻去者欲行　彼之分別說　智分別說已　所行如智用.","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[六]菩提之願心　大果如輪迴　福故不閒斷　亦如彼行意.","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[七]若彼等無邊　有情界解脫　與彼心平等　菩提願不退.","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"彼等好睡眠　亦復多迷醉　閒斷於福流　喻空無所有.","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[八]妙臂而問此　劣意之有情　於解脫得生　爲自爲如來.","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]戊次讚爲成佛因.","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]二本此半頌結雲.欲離諸趣依處者.當善憶持菩提心.","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]戊三讚增善滅苦.二本此頌初句雲自餘諸善如芭蕉.","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]戊四依教成立功德無量二本此半頌雲.卽彼功德無有量.慈氏嘗爲善財說.","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]丁次別釋.又四.今戊初標分二類.二本此頌意雲.彼菩提心.要有二類.一願菩提.二入菩提.","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[六]戊次別釋願心功德.二本此頌意雲.願雖流轉中.能生於大果.然不如入心.福德無間斷.","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[七]戊三別釋入心功德.","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[八]勘二本此下引教.如妙臂問經中.如來爲勝解下劣有情說法.但有療治有情疾苦之心.亦得無邊福德.","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"乃思惟療除　苦惱之有情　使苦惱盡已　獲得無邊福.","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"有情無邊苦　雲何而療治　使一一安樂　獲無邊功德.","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"何以利父母　如是及眷屬　得天及仙人　淨行婆羅門.","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如是彼有情　乃過去睡夢　不願於自利　唯願生利他.","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"有情最勝寶　希有[一]何得生　種種意利他　不獨於自利.","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]歡喜世閒種　精進世閒藥　心寶與有福　而彼雲何[三]說.","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"雲何諸有情　得一切快樂　爲發菩提心　供養於如來.","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"迷愛樂快樂　乃喻於寃嫌　遠離與隨行　悉從於自意.","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若心求快樂　苦惱種無邊　積諸善快樂　諸苦惱消除.","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"破壞迷惑因　善哉雲何得　親彼善知識　彼福如是得.","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"作利若迴向　彼必返讚歎　作善不求利　說彼是菩薩.","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若有布施於少食　修善供養於世閒　所施大小如蚊蚋　亦獲快樂得半日.","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]據二本當作忽.","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]戊四別釋入心展轉生福.","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]據二本當作量.","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]雲何獲得於能仁　要度無邊有情盡　有情無盡若虛空　一切智求自圓滿.","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"佛子靜念而思惟　若煩惱生自心作　數生煩惱復生疑　佛說此人墮地獄.","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"佛子若發菩提心　滅大罪力得勝果.","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"我今歸命摩尼心　救度有情得快樂。","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]菩提心施供養品第二","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]端彼摩尼恭敬心　用奉供養於如來　及彼清淨妙法寶　[四]佛功德海量無邊.","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"世閒所有諸妙華　乃至妙果及湯藥　所有珍寶澄清水　悉皆奉供而適意.","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"山中之寶及衆寶　適悅樹林寂靜處　蔓華莊嚴樹光明　結果低垂枝[橠-多+可]橠.","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"人閒天上香塗香　乃至劫樹及寶樹　[五]池水清淨復莊嚴　鵝鴻好聲極適意.","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"穀自然生非所種　別別莊嚴而供養　等虛空界量廣大　此一切有悉受用.","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"我今所獻幷子等　供養最上佛牟尼　爲我不捨於大悲　受彼最上之供養.","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"我以無福大貧窮　更無纖毫別供養　我今思惟爲自他　願佛受斯隨力施.","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]據二本當作何况.","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]二本懺罪品第二.","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]丙後明發心儀軌.又二.丁初淨心七緣.又七.今初明供養.","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]二本作佛子.意謂僧寶.","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]二本此半頌與次半頌互倒.","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]我自身施一切佛　以自身等徧一切　加被我作上有情　有情恆常佛教化.","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"我得如來加被已　化利有情無怖畏　過去罪樂悉遠離　未來衆罪不復作.","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"寶光明處甚適悅　天蓋莊嚴奉真如　水精清淨復光明　種種妙堂香浴作.","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"大寶瓶滿盛香水　復著適意諸妙華　洗浴如來無垢身　我當讚詠獻歌樂.","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"清淨香熏上妙衣　用蓋覆彼最上色　我今獻此上衣服　願佛慈悲哀納受.","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"種種柔輭妙天衣　彼莊嚴中而最上　供養如來幷普賢　及彼文殊觀自[二]在。","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]護戒品第三","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]持戒爲護心　護之使堅牢　此心不能護　雲何能護戒.","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]喻醉象不降　不患於疼痛　放心如醉象　當招阿鼻等.","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"念索常執持　繫縛於心象　得離放逸怖　獲一切安樂.","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[六]若能繫一心　一切皆能繫　若自降一心　一切自降伏.","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"師子熊虎狼　夜叉羅刹等　一切地獄卒　皆悉是其寃.","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]藏本缺此一頌.","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]二本此下有五十三頌.(藏本缺一頌)歷明淨心七支.次有持菩提心品第三.三十二頌.詳說前科文中丁第二段.發心儀軌.又次有顯示不放逸品第四.四十九頌.詳說隨行學處中最初戒品之半.(科文乙後明成道所依.隨行學處.又五.丙初明修戒度.又二.丁初明勤護學處修不放逸.)今均缺文.","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]二本用意護持品第五.","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]科段.丁後明清淨方便修用意護持.又三.戊初明爲護戒故護心.又四.今己初略標.","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]己次明不護有失守護有得故應護心.二本此頌雲.意象能招.阿鼻等果.野象狂放.不如其惡.","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[六]二本此下二頌互倒.","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若怖一切寃　無邊苦惱集　皆因心所得　佛世尊正說.","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"地獄衆苦器　及熱鐵丸等　誰作復何生　[一]貪瞋癡所有.","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"由彼諸罪心　佛生諸世閒　三界心滅故　是故無怖畏.","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若昔行檀施　今世而不貧　今貧勿煩惱　過去雲何悔.","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]若人心少分　行檀波羅蜜　是故說果報　同一切布施.","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]若人心持戒　嫌誰而牽殺.","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]嗔心之寃家　殺盡等虛空.","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"大地量無邊　何皮而能蓋　屨用皮少分　隨行處處覆.","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"外我性亦然　所有誰能勸　但勸於自心　外我而自伏.","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"身貧而無福　彼果同所行　若心施一衣　感果而增福.","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"諸行若修持　心念恆不捨　一切無利心　虛假宜遠離.","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]一切心法財　宜祕密觀察　離苦獲安樂　彼得超世閒.","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]二本缺此句.","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]二本此頌意雲.以財物及果.施一切衆生.說心爲施度.故此義唯心.","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]二本此頌意雲.不爲誰何.而殺魚等.此離害心.乃爲戒度.","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]二本此頌意雲.瞋怨量如空.不能悉降伏.但除一念瞋.卽巳伏一切.","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]二本此頌意雲.若不知法中.最勝心祕密.(卽自性空)願得樂離苦.悉皆成無義.","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"我雲何修行　修行唯護心　是故我觀心　恆時而作護。","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]喻獼猻身瘡　一心而將護　人中惡如是　恆常而護心.","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]怖苦惱之瘡　我一心常護　破壞於衆合　心瘡乃無怖。","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"常作如是行　不行人中惡　人中罪不犯　自然而不怖.","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"我欲盡身命　利行而供養　別別身命盡　善心而不退。","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]我欲守護心　合掌今專作　心念念之中　一切方便護。","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]喻於重病人　諸事不寧忍　散亂心亦然　不堪諸事業.","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"心散亂不定　聞思惟觀察　如器之滲漏　於水不能盛.","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"由多聞之人　於信方便等　過失心不定　獲不寂靜罪.","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"心不決定故　迷惑賊所得　所有之福善　偷墮於無處.","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"煩惱衆盜賊　魔著故得便　由魔羅發起　破壞善生命。","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]守彼意根門　惡不能牽去　念彼罪苦惱　次復獲安住.","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]己三明護心之相.","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]己四明護所獲益.","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]戊次明爲護心故當用意憶持.又四.今己初教誡用意.","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]己次明不用意過失.","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]己三明護念.","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"善哉隨師教　獲得善念生　奉於教誨師　當一心供給.","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"於諸佛菩薩　刹那心決定　當怖畏憶念　慈哀現面前.","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]塵心而不定　去去不復還.","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若能守意門　護之住不散.","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"我今護此心　恆常如是住　喻木之無根　不生惡枝葉.","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"眼觀於色相　知虛假不實　物物恆諦觀　是故而不著.","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"因見而觀察　觀之令不惑　所來觀見已　安[二]畏以善來.","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"欲行不知道　望四方生怖　決定知方已　觀心行亦然.","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"智者之所行　思惟於前後　是善是惡等　如是事不失。","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]不住於此身　離此復何作　雲何住此身　當復觀中閒.","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"觀內心亦然　而用諸方便　以法爲大柱　縛之令不脫.","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"當以如是意　觀我之所在　諸識皆如是　攝令刹那住.","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]二本此頌意雲.如是思惟.而有慚愧.喜歡畏敬.時時念佛.","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]據二本當作慰.","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]己四明憶持.又五今庚初略標身心分位觀察憶持.","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若怖因業力　能趣求快樂　修彼檀戒度　乃至大捨等.","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若修菩提因　彼別不思惟　一向修自心　當起如是見.","sortOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如是修諸善　不起於怖畏　而令諸煩惱　決定不增長.","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"種種正言說　見在而甚多　觀覽悉決了　破疑網得果.","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如草被割截　念佛戒能忍　刹那行此行　獲得殊勝果。","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]欲於諸正說　皆悉得通達　當觀照自心　常修於精進.","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"喻木之無情　無言無所作　見自心亦然　決定令如是.","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"心起於輕慢　如彼迷醉人　惟求自讚譽　非彼修行者.","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若他人於我　而生於毀謗　謂是瞋癡等　住心恆似木.","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如木不分別　利養尊卑稱　亦不爲眷屬　乃至承事等.","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"利他不自利　但欲爲一切　是故說我心　堅住恆如木.","sortOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"一心住如木　於尊親朋友　乃至於三業　不生憎愛怖.","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]庚次別釋染淨心分位各各憶持.","sortOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"觀察於煩惱　如空而不著　當勇猛堅牢　受持爲恆常.","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"無善慚可怖　當一心求他　清淨住三昧　爲他所尊重.","sortOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"雖居童稚位　不使他瞋惱　自亦不瞋他　慈悲恆若此.","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"我受持禪那　使意恆寂靜　爲一切有情　恆居無罪處.","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"念念須臾閒　多時爲最勝　如是受持心　不動如須彌。","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]鷲貪肉不厭　人貪善亦然　身心不修行　雲何能出離.","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"雲何護身意　一切時自勤　汝等何所行　各各專一心.","sortOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"愚迷不自製　妄貪如木身　此身不淨作　雲何返愛戀.","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"骨鎖肉連持　外皮而莊飾　自覺令不貪　解脫於慧刃.","sortOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"割截諸身分　令見中精髓　審觀察思惟　雲何見有人.","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"一心如是觀　審諦不見人　雲何不淨身　貪愛而守護.","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"處胎食不淨　出胎飲血乳　不如是食飲　雲何作此身.","sortOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]庚三別釋身分位觀察憶持.","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"豺鷲等貪食　不分善與惡.　[一]要同人愛身　受用成業累.","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"但如是護身　至死無慈忍　與豺鷲無別　汝何恆此作.","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"身死識不住　衣食寧可留　身謝識必往　受用雲何貪.","sortOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"是故今作意　不貪如是事　如是不遠離　得彼諸不善.","sortOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如似人生身　肢體求成就　受身智不增　輪還徒自困.","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"於世親非親　悅顏先慰喻　如是常自製　心念恆不捨。","sortOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]笑不得高聲　不戲擲坐具　輕手擊他門　諦信恆自執.","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如盜如猫鷺　求事行無聲　修心亦如此　當離於麤獷.","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"他人之所嫌　無義利不說　恆得諸弟子　言上而尊愛.","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"一切所言說　聞之使稱善　觀彼作福事　稱讚令歡喜.","sortOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"衷私說彼德　彼聞心必喜　欲讚說彼時　先觀彼德行.","sortOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"修諸歡喜事　難得彼誠心　勤修利他德　當受快樂報.","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]二本此半頌意雲.要以人身.供他使役.自下別爲一段.","sortOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]庚四釋廣修憶持行.又三.今辛初明斷非理及無益所作故修.","sortOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"憎愛苦宜捨　來生大苦故　此苦我不住　來生大快樂。","sortOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]善言聲柔輭　悲根聞生喜　顯彼適意事　當信真實語.","sortOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"恆悲念有情　愛護如愛眼　爲彼住真實　必當得成佛.","sortOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"彼真實得成　各此利朋友　刹那修功德　離苦大安樂.","sortOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"功德殷勤修　恆作而自得　不衒不覆藏　誰雲諸事等。","sortOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]檀波羅蜜等　殊妙而最上　別行非最上　利[三]下無遠離.","sortOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"佛如是利他　恆常之所切　如來之教中　見彼慈悲事.","sortOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"三界師入滅　分別出家人　食有可不可　不離三衣等.","sortOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"將求妙法身　不苦惱衆生　於衆生如是　隨意獲圓滿.","sortOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"捨非須盡命　彼捨要平等　悲心當清淨　果報自圓滿.","sortOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]淨心而重法　不執器杖等　不持傘蓋頭　無諸輕慢事.","sortOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]爲男子女人　說法深廣大　不分人勝劣　令彼重平等.","sortOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]辛次明尊敬有情及入善行故修.","sortOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]辛三明爲諸度行故修.","sortOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]據二本當作他.","sortOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]二本此頌意謂不爲覆頭持傘等人說法.自下十一頌皆屬戒本學處.","sortOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]二本此半頌意雲劣根不爲說廣法.獨居女子不爲說.","sortOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]法之不廣大　乃及非法行　遠離不敬禮　樂說於大乘.","sortOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"齒木及洟唾　不棄於淨地　淨水及淨舍　勿得棄便痢.","sortOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"喫食勿滿口　食勿令有聲　食時不語言　亦勿大開口.","sortOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"坐不得垂足　行亦不挑臂　不與女同乘　亦不同坐臥","sortOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"諸所不律事　人見心不喜　一切人旣覩　遠離而不敬.","sortOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"人問於道路　不得一[二]手指　[三]雙手而指之　示其道所至.","sortOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"凡所諸行步　不弄臂作聲　亦勿妄彈指　威儀如是守.","sortOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]師雖已化滅　四儀應當學　奉戒行不輕　決定獲聖果.","sortOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"菩薩行無量　所說無有邊　[五]當以清淨心　決定而奉行.","sortOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"於一晝一夜　分之各三時　[六]行道普懺悔　住佛菩提心.","sortOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"菩提心自住　亦令他獲得　佛子住學戒　一心如是持.","sortOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"佛戒體清淨　不見有纖毫　恆作如是行　彼福無有量.","sortOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]二本此頌意雲.於廣大法器.不應說小乘.不可全捨戒.不可雜顯密.","sortOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]據二本當作指.","sortOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]二本作一.","sortOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[四]二本此半頌意雲.應如佛滅儀.面北向而臥.","sortOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[五]二本此半頌雲.當依決定說.行淨心諸行.","sortOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[六]二本此半頌意雲.行懺悔隨喜.及迴向三蘊.","sortOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"無始爲有情　行行而不別　如是爲有情　化令一切覺.","sortOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"當知善知識　如命不可捨　菩薩戒最上　大乘法亦爾.","sortOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]解脫依師學　而能生吉祥　佛佛說智經　讀之見戒法.","sortOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]若人心護戒　所行悉已見.","sortOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"若身若心位　當微細觀察.","sortOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"口誦身不行　當得何所喻　譬如重病人　空談於藥力.","sortOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]虛空藏經中　說謨羅波底.","sortOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"如見集戒定　廣如經所說.","sortOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"聖龍樹菩薩　一心之所集　隨所住之處　勸恆伸供養.","sortOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"菩提行經卷第一","sortOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[一]二本此半頌意雲.當學吉祥生.所說事師法.其詳見樹莊嚴經.","sortOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[二]二本此下三頌在後出.初頌意雲.此中未製.而應行者.護世人心.視同學處.次頌科文中庚五總結護持.末頌戊三兼教護心憶持兩事.","sortOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_335_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_335","text":"[三]二本此下三頌在前出.初頌意雲.學處因經現.故應讀諸經.虛空藏經者.此則應先讀.次頌意雲.集菩薩學處.(論名)依經而顯示.爲菩提常行.亦應時時觀.末頌意雲先應觀略本.一切經要集.(論名)此龍樹二書.皆應勤守持.按此頌文以學處集論爲龍樹之作.但其現行本題寂天自著.是龍樹寂天二家著書名實久淆.宋人譯此寂天入菩提行而改題爲龍樹造.或亦源於此歟.","sortOrder":253}],"overrides":{}}